From: Andrew Udvare <audvare@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Never build the inherited BasicSR CUDA extensions

setup.py builds deform_conv_ext, fused_act_ext and upfirdn2d_ext unless
--no_cuda_ext is passed, which a PEP 517 build has no way to do.

Nothing needs them: they come from BasicSR, and the only import sites in
basicsr/models/archs/arch_util.py are commented out upstream.

make_cuda_ext() also chooses between CppExtension and CUDAExtension by calling
torch.cuda.is_available() at build time, so what got built depended on whether
a GPU happened to be visible to the builder.

diff --git a/setup.py b/setup.py
index 68c4dfc..992cf73 100644
--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -129,30 +129,12 @@ def get_requirements(filename='requirements.txt'):
 
 
 if __name__ == '__main__':
+    # The deformable-conv, fused-act and upfirdn2d ops come from BasicSR
+    # and no NAFNet architecture uses them: the only import sites, in
+    # basicsr/models/archs/arch_util.py, are commented out.
+    ext_modules = []
     if '--no_cuda_ext' in sys.argv:
-        ext_modules = []
         sys.argv.remove('--no_cuda_ext')
-    else:
-        ext_modules = [
-            make_cuda_ext(
-                name='deform_conv_ext',
-                module='basicsr.models.ops.dcn',
-                sources=['src/deform_conv_ext.cpp'],
-                sources_cuda=[
-                    'src/deform_conv_cuda.cpp',
-                    'src/deform_conv_cuda_kernel.cu'
-                ]),
-            make_cuda_ext(
-                name='fused_act_ext',
-                module='basicsr.models.ops.fused_act',
-                sources=['src/fused_bias_act.cpp'],
-                sources_cuda=['src/fused_bias_act_kernel.cu']),
-            make_cuda_ext(
-                name='upfirdn2d_ext',
-                module='basicsr.models.ops.upfirdn2d',
-                sources=['src/upfirdn2d.cpp'],
-                sources_cuda=['src/upfirdn2d_kernel.cu']),
-        ]
 
     write_version_py()
     setup(
